<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 20:32:14 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>《财富》AIQ 峰会：对话已从实验转向执行</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/12/aiq-summit-summary-wrap-from-experimentation-to-execution/</link><description>最强大的公司不仅仅是分发人工智能工具，而是重新设计工作流程、培养人才、加强治理和建立纪律。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/55563856820_e178c54b78_3k.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 20:04:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/12/aiq-summit-summary-wrap-from-experimentation-to-execution/</guid></item><item><title>由于燃油成本飙升，航空公司提高了票价，但达美航空首席执行官表示，只要需求保持不变，票价上涨就可能会持续下去</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/12/delta-ceo-ed-bastian-higher-airfares-could-be-here-to-stay-even-if-fuel-prices-fall/</link><description>石油价格比一年前上涨了 70% 以上。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2282950676-e1791831290106.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 19:18:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/12/delta-ceo-ed-bastian-higher-airfares-could-be-here-to-stay-even-if-fuel-prices-fall/</guid></item><item><title>沃伦·巴菲特观看 YouTube，大卫·所罗门 DJ，这位前 NFL 教练花了 12 年时间玩《我的世界》</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/11/hobbies-part-of-secret-for-success-former-nfl-coach-mike-tomlin-built-twelve-year-minecraft-city/</link><description>迈克·汤姆林 (Mike Tomlin) 因其 12 年《我的世界》城市而广为人知，与沃伦·巴菲特 (Warren Buffett) 和大卫·所罗门 (David Solomon) 一样，他展示了兴趣爱好如何帮助人们为成功充电。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2297791534-e1791571839390.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 08:02:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/11/hobbies-part-of-secret-for-success-former-nfl-coach-mike-tomlin-built-twelve-year-minecraft-city/</guid></item><item><title>今年秋天，电视上将播出选举赔率。 60% 的美国人反对押注选举</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/12/election-odds-tv-americans-disapprove-cbs-cnn/</link><description>路透社/益普索的一项新民意调查显示，各电视网正在将预测市场价格纳入其中期报道中，大多数公众对政治赌注持保留态度。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2182517675-e1791828899328.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 18:30:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/12/election-odds-tv-americans-disapprove-cbs-cnn/</guid></item><item><title>萨蒂亚·纳德拉 (Satya Nadella) 从一名 H-1B 员工变成了微软 CEO。特朗普政府刚刚为其员工关闭了这条道路</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/microsoft-satya-nadella-green-card-perm-suspension-vance-h1b/</link><description>副总裁JD Vance指责微软用“外国契约劳工”取代下岗的美国人，并暂停其PERM绿卡计划&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2298610036.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 19:37:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/microsoft-satya-nadella-green-card-perm-suspension-vance-h1b/</guid></item><item><title>满足人工智能热潮的新能源许可法案将化石燃料和清洁能源联合起来，同时分裂了绿色能源和环保主义者</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/11/energy-permitting-ai-fossil-fuels-clean-power-environmentalists/</link><description>该立法加快了从天然气管道到太阳能发电场的一切，但可能引发更多的环境风险。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2297379281-e1791579949201.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 07:09:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/11/energy-permitting-ai-fossil-fuels-clean-power-environmentalists/</guid></item><item><title>Twilio 的首席执行官在晚餐时面试候选人 45 分钟，如果你说“我”太多或者不问任何问题，你就不会得到这份工作</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/twilio-ceo-interviews-candidates-for-45-minutes-over-dinner-hes-listening-for-one-word-in-particular-and-youre-not-hired-if-you-say-it-too-much/</link><description>独家报道：Twilio 首席执行官 Khozema Shipchandler 警告求职者，两个常见的面试错误可能会让他们失去工作：跳过问题或过于依赖“我”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/GettyImages-1485222107-e1757415514967.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 13:15:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/twilio-ceo-interviews-candidates-for-45-minutes-over-dinner-hes-listening-for-one-word-in-particular-and-youre-not-hired-if-you-say-it-too-much/</guid></item><item><title>来认识一下 Aurora：每年 10,000 美元的人工智能礼宾服务，仅限受邀者参加，可预测超级富豪的每一个需求</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/11/meet-aurora-invite-only-ai-concierge-ultrawealthy-pay-10000-a-year-to-anticipate-their-every-need/</link><description>在风投和家族办公室 1200 万美元的支持下，Aurora 将人工智能与人类时尚引领者结合起来，管理会员的健康、旅行和餐饮。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/aurora-e1791574104925.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 11:29:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/11/meet-aurora-invite-only-ai-concierge-ultrawealthy-pay-10000-a-year-to-anticipate-their-every-need/</guid></item><item><title>Vikrom Kromadit 在泰国和越南建立了他的工业园帝国。老挝是下一个</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/12/amata-industrial-park-thailand-vietnam-laos/</link><description>老挝的绿色能源潜力是安美德首席执行官将这个内陆国家称为“东南亚电池”的原因。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2235627275.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 08:32:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/12/amata-industrial-park-thailand-vietnam-laos/</guid></item><item><title>在美国页岩油产区的中心地带，石油盗窃案呈上升趋势，而且大多是有针对性、有组织的抢劫行为</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/11/oil-theft-wti-crude-prices-permian-basin-targeted-organized-heists/</link><description>达拉斯联储的一项调查显示，受到石油盗窃影响的高管中有 32% 表示，过去 12 个月，石油盗窃事件略有增加。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2290383209-e1791752598602.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 22:25:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/11/oil-theft-wti-crude-prices-permian-basin-targeted-organized-heists/</guid></item></channel></rss>